; TAKE (8) may acquire an object without spending a turn; HAVE (2) rejects
; an unheld object. TRYTAKE objects bypass the low-level automatic ITAKE.
; This is native ERB, not a Python gameplay callback.
@Z_LOAD_SYNTAX_METADATA
VARSET Z_TRYTAKE
